# Keeps the artifacts/ directory present in the CI workspace.
#
# The "Package portable ZIP" workflow step writes
#   Compress-Archive -DestinationPath <workspace>\artifacts\NEREA-win-x64.zip
# and PowerShell's Compress-Archive does NOT create missing parent
# directories. Checking this file in materializes artifacts/ at checkout so
# the ZIP (and the Inno Setup installer output) have a destination.
